Package: evolution-sieve-filters
Architecture: any
Depends: evolution (>= 3.54),
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Sieve mail filter management plugin for Evolution
 Evolution module that manages server-side Sieve mail filters over
 ManageSieve (RFC 5804). Provides a visual rule editor as well as a raw
 script editor integrated into Evolution's account settings and message
 context menus.
 .
 The ManageSieve client, SASL layer (PLAIN, LOGIN, CRAM-MD5, SCRAM-SHA-1,
 SCRAM-SHA-256, OAUTHBEARER, XOAUTH2) and Sieve rule model are
 self-contained GLib/GIO code, independently testable from Evolution.
